{"file": "story1.txt-000-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2159, "end": 2196}, "text": "“Your brother called,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 37}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 33}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-000-37", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2196, "end": 2220}, "text": "“He wants the boat.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 24}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 20}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-001-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2221, "end": 2275}, "text": "“He can want it untill the water freezes,” I said.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 54}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 50}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-002-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2421, "end": 2465}, "text": "“He says the ferry is dying,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 44}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 40}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-002-44", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2465, "end": 2546}, "text": "“He says there are easier ways to lose money, and he says he knows them all.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 81}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 77}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-003-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2547, "end": 2572}, "text": "“There are,” I said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 25}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 21}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-003-25", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2572, "end": 2617}, "text": "“But none of them come with such a view.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 45}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 41}, "category": "coordinatingConjunction", "pattern": "coordinatingConjunction", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-004-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 3709, "end": 3756}, "text": "“You keep the books like a banker,” I said.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 47}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 43}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-005-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 3757, "end": 3835}, "text": "“And you keep the boat like a priest,” she said , and put her hat back on.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 78}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 74}, "category": "coordinatingConjunction", "pattern": "coordinatingConjunction", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-006-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4340, "end": 4379}, "text": "“The island is a museum,” he said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 39}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 35}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-006-39", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4379, "end": 4405}, "text": "“You are the exhibit.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 26}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 22}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-007-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4406, "end": 4459}, "text": "“Somebody has to keep the light burning,” I said.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 53}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 49}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-008-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4460, "end": 4499}, "text": "“Nobody needs the light,” he said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 39}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 35}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-008-39", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4499, "end": 4578}, "text": "“They have radar now, and radar never sleeps and never asks for a day off.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 79}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 75}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-009-0", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 5519, "end": 5566}, "text": "“They’ve scheduled a meeting,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 47}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 41}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-009-47", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 5566, "end": 5579}, "text": "“Thursday. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 13}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 11}, "category": "other", "pattern": "other", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story1.txt-009-60", "source": "story1.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 5579, "end": 5713}, "text": "In the church, because it’s the only place big enough. They’re calling it a consultation, but you and I both know what it is.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 134}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 126}, "category": "introductory", "pattern": "introductory", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "df8067629b0529639086a71f856af8a7a275cb0a"}
{"file": "story2.txt-000-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 834, "end": 876}, "text": "“It belonged to my mother,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 42}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 38}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-000-42", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 876, "end": 913}, "text": "“It hasn’t run since she died.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 37}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 31}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-001-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 1027, "end": 1068}, "text": "“I can fix almost anything,” I said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 41}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 37}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-001-41", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 1068, "end": 1106}, "text": "“But I can’t fix what it means.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 38}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 32}, "category": "coordinatingConjunction", "pattern": "coordinatingConjunction", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-002-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2027, "end": 2108}, "text": "“You’re still here,” she said, as if she had expected the river to take me.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 81}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 75}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-003-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2109, "end": 2142}, "text": "“I am hard to move,” I said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 33}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 29}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-003-33", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2142, "end": 2165}, "text": "“Like a grand piano. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 23}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 21}, "category": "introductory", "pattern": "introductory", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-003-56", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2165, "end": 2180}, "text": "Or a grudge.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 15}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 13}, "category": "coordinatingConjunction", "pattern": "coordinatingConjunction", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-004-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2604, "end": 2647}, "text": "“You should come to dinner,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 43}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 39}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-004-43", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 2647, "end": 2712}, "text": "“I can accomodate one more chair, and I have done it before.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 65}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 61}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-005-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 3786, "end": 3890}, "text": "“You talk to it,” Ines said from the doorway, and I realized she had been watching me for some time.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 104}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 100}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-006-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 3891, "end": 3940}, "text": "“It listens better than most people,” I said.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 49}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 45}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-007-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4049, "end": 4089}, "text": "“I’d like take a walk,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 40}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 34}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-007-40", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4089, "end": 4147}, "text": "“The water’s down, and I have been inside for days.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 58}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 52}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-008-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4236, "end": 4296}, "text": "“People think a flooded town is a sad place,” she said. ", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 60}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 56}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-008-60", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4296, "end": 4338}, "text": "“But it’s just a town that got wet.”", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 42}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 36}, "category": "coordinatingConjunction", "pattern": "coordinatingConjunction", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
{"file": "story2.txt-009-0", "source": "story2.txt", "sourceByte": {"start": 4556, "end": 4651}, "text": "“My mother used to say that grief is love with nowhere to go,” she said, without my asking.", "byte": {"start": 0, "end": 95}, "utf16": {"start": 0, "end": 91}, "category": "subject", "pattern": "subject", "labeler": "single-codex-labeler; provisional, owner adjudication pending", "sourceBlob": "dc35f8c266b96c88aafbd3eecb7f9229e6fc27e8"}
